OCGRAPH 1
DOMAIN gameplay
# A class with a component tree and nothing else: a body mesh and a point under it. No ENTRY, so it never
# ticks. Meshes/cube.ocmesh is the editor's built-in unit cube; `scale` is its half-extent in cm.
NAME CompProbe
CLASS AN_CompProbe Actor
COMP body Mesh mesh=Meshes/cube.ocmesh scale=50,50,50
COMP tip Scene parent=body pos=0,0,1
